Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: Rosetun
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/eoftgge/rosetun/issues
Source: https://github.com/eoftgge/rosetun
Comment:
 The full licence texts and the Rust crates' notices are in
 /usr/share/doc/rosetun/licenses/. third-party.html there lists every Rust crate
 compiled into Rosetun with its licence.

Files: *
Copyright: Rosetun contributors
License: GPL-3+

Files: usr/lib/rosetun/sing-box
Copyright: 2022 nekohasekai <contact-sagernet@sekai.icu>
License: GPL-3+
Comment:
 The unmodified official sing-box @SING_BOX_VERSION@ build, with the additional term
 in licenses/sing-box.txt on the use of its name. Corresponding source: see
 licenses/sing-box-source.txt.

Files: usr/lib/rosetun/xray
Copyright: Xray-core contributors
License: MPL-2.0
Comment:
 The unmodified official Xray-core @XRAY_VERSION@ build. Corresponding source: see
 licenses/xray-source.txt.

Files: usr/lib/rosetun/rosetun-gui
Copyright: Rosetun contributors
License: GPL-3+ and OFL-1.1
Comment:
 The GUI embeds the Manrope and Cormorant Garamond fonts under OFL-1.1; their
 copyright lines are in licenses/OFL-Manrope.txt and
 licenses/OFL-CormorantGaramond.txt. Like the helper and the CLI, it is built
 with Rust crates under the licences in licenses/third-party.html.

License: GPL-3+
 This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify it under
 the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software
 Foundation, either version 3 of the License, or (at your option) any later
 version.
 .
 On Debian systems, the complete text of the GNU General Public License version
 3 can be found in /usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-3.

License: MPL-2.0
 On Debian systems, the complete text of the Mozilla Public License 2.0 can be
 found in /usr/share/common-licenses/MPL-2.0, and in licenses/xray-mpl-2.0.txt.

License: OFL-1.1
 The complete text of the SIL Open Font License 1.1 is in
 /usr/share/doc/rosetun/licenses/OFL-Manrope.txt and OFL-CormorantGaramond.txt.
